s://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/8_V1RI7OvrU/maxresdefault.webp", "preference": 0, "id": "49"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8_V1RI7OvrU/sddefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCIAFEOAD8quKqQMa8AEB-AH-DoACuAiKAgwIABABGBMgRih_MA8=&rs=AOn4CLD0GuyhIQ8XogrKBFAZVtaznnRlOg", "description": "Looking for a new approach to marketing that will help you grab the attention of your hottest potential clients? Interested in tangible media products to help your company stand out?\n\nLook no further! Video brochures offer all of those perks, and more.\n\nVideo brochures from MediaFast are composed of a screen embedded into a custom print presentation. When the cover is opened, a digital screen with interactive buttons is displayed. These video books can be customized in a variety of sizes ranging from small business cards to much bigger video boxes.\n\nOur screen sizes range from 3” to 10”, and all screens are HD. The most common size fits in your hand like a book while being lighter than you could ever imagine.\n\nUse video brochures for all sorts of business purposes, presentations, advertisements, and invitations. Hospitals & medical centers, luxury product manufacturers, the NFL, travel agencies, and more have all used them to promote themselves.\n\nThey can be as unique as you want. When ordering, you can pick the screen size, the memory size, print options, and button functions. And the best part—they're rechargeable so recipients can watch your new marketing product over and over again.\n\nCheck out the MediaFast website to choose from hundreds of templates. They're fun and easy to design, and ROI with them is fantastic!\n\nOr to get your FREE sample, visit https://mediafast.com/video-brochure/", "channel_id": "UCE3b4IuQl90tI0z3zZqQY2Q", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCE3b4IuQl90tI0z3zZqQY2Q", "duration": 11, "view_count": 69, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8_V1RI7OvrU", "categories": ["Education"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "